                <pb facs="0831" n="717" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg717"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3412/2: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-05-12T12:00:00-03:00">May 12, 1931—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received
                        2:15 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>27. Your 28, May 5, 4 p.m.<anchor n="48" xml:id="d558-f1"/> The following is
                    strictly confidential for the Secretary.</p>
                <p>Yesterday the Brazilian Minister for Foreign Affairs inquired if the Department
                    would regard with favor a suggestion to cooperate with the Government of Brazil
                    in proposing a plan to harmonize the interests of Bolivia and Paraguay on all
                    matters on which they disagree and which occasion recurring friction. If
                    agreeable to the Department the Minister would propose that the Department
                    prepare a draft proposition which when accepted by Brazil should be presented
                    simultaneously and in the same form by the Governments of the United States and
                    of Brazil to Bolivia and Paraguay. Only the Governments of the United States and
                    of Brazil should take this action, and until the approved proposition is
                    submitted to the Governments of Bolivia and Paraguay knowledge thereof should
                    not be made known in any way to any South American or Central American
                    government.</p>
                <p>I transmit this suggestion to you at the request of the Minister.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
